WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.725
The advisor, not the actor.

00:00:03.925 --> 00:00:08.525
It receives only permitted signals, and keeps provenance for every line.

00:00:09.725 --> 00:00:15.025
Secrets die pre-storage: keys and tokens redacted before anything is written.

00:00:16.225 --> 00:00:20.700
The evidence journal hash-chains every record. Tampering breaks the chain.

00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:27.150
Projections build focus, session, and uncertainty views across timescales.

00:00:28.350 --> 00:00:33.700
Consumers get bounded snapshots: disclaimers attached, expiry enforced.

00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:39.875
Ten minutes to live.  Then the brief expires, by construction.

00:00:41.675 --> 00:00:45.750
Zero action dispatchers. It advises. It never acts.

00:00:47.550 --> 00:00:53.050
Reflex advice is future work, blocked on defects. No Trace backend assumed.

00:00:54.250 --> 00:00:59.200
Memory that warns, never grabs.  Serve it locally.
